{"path":"mainstory/episode_01/chapter_1/main_chapter01_06_01","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"의지를 불태우는 두부단.\n우리 바보 삼인방도 질 수 없지를 외치며\n의지를 불태우는 중이다.","en":"The Tofu Troupe is fired up and ready to go.\nNot to be outdone, our trio of idiots\nis getting fired up too.","ja":"意志を燃やす豆腐団。\n我らがバカ３人組も負けてたまるかと、\n意志を燃やしている。","zh-Hans":"燃烧意志的豆腐团。\n我们的笨蛋三人组也喊着决不能输，\n同样在燃烧着意志。","zh-Hant":"意志高昂的豆腐團。\n我們這邊的笨蛋三人組也喊著不能輸，\n同樣燃起了意志。","th":"คณะเต้าหู้ต่างลุกฮือด้วยเจตจำนงอันแรงกล้า\nยัยบื้อสามคนของพวกเราเองก็ไม่ยอมแพ้ พร้อมตะโกนลั่น\nและกำลังลุกพะเพลิงด้วยเจตจำนงอันแรงกล้าเช่นกัน","es":"La Compañía del Tofu arde en Voluntad.\nNuestro trío de bobas arde también en Voluntad,\ngritando que no se dejarán superar."}}},{"class":"TitleCommand","line":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":2,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":3,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ma1","Origin":"maid_novice_201"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":4,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"mb1","Origin":"maid_novice_202"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":5,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ma2","Origin":"maid_novice_201"}},{"class":"ModifyBackground","line":6,"fields":{"Duration":"1.5","Wait":"false","AppearanceAndTransition":"BG_Panoticon_Corridor","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":7,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"PlaceCommand","line":8,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"파노티콘 복도","en":"Panoticon Hallway","ja":"パノプチコンの廊下","zh-Hans":"潘诺普蒂空走廊","zh-Hant":"潘諾普蒂空走廊","th":"ทางเดินพานอปติคอน","es":"Pasillo del Panopticon"}}},{"class":"AuthorCommand","line":9,"fields":{"CharacterId":"victoria","AuthorLabel":""},"loc":{"AuthorLabel":{"ko":"빅토리아","en":"Victoria","ja":"ヴィクトリア","zh-Hans":"维多利亚","zh-Hant":"維多利亞","th":"วิกตอเรีย","es":"Victoria"}}},{"class":"AuthorCommand","line":10,"fields":{"CharacterId":"rona","AuthorLabel":""},"loc":{"AuthorLabel":{"ko":"로나","en":"Rona","ja":"ロナ","zh-Hans":"罗娜","zh-Hant":"羅娜","th":"โรนา","