"IdAndAppearance":"victoria.serious","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":114,"fields":{"WaitMode":"2"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":116,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":117,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"suji.chaos","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":118,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji.embarrassed","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":118,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"suji","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"이, 이래도 되는 거 맞나…","texts":{"en":"I-Is this really okay...?","ja":"こ、これで本当にいいのかな…","zh-Hans":"这、这样真的没问题吗……","zh-Hant":"這、這樣真的好嗎……","th":"จะ... จะดีจริงๆ เหรอเนี่ย...","es":"¿D-De verdad estará bien hacer esto...?"},"author":"suji"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":119,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":120,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":121,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"victoria.smile","Wait":"false","Destination":"45","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":122,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"victoria","Wait":"false","Power":"5","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":123,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.02"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":124,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji.fear","Wait":"false","Destination":"20","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":125,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji","Wait":"false","Power":"7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":126,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"suji.surprise","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":127,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"victoria.respond","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":128,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":129,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"victoria.happy","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":129,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"victoria","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"뭘 걱정하는 거야~ 우리가 뒷골목에서 치고받은 놈들만 해도 얘네보다 강하거든?","texts":{"en":"What are you worried about? The guys we used to fight in the back alleys are way stronger than them!","ja":"何を心配してるわけ～☆ 私たちが路地裏でやり合った奴らの方が、こいつらよりずっと強いんだから！","zh-Hans":"担心什么嘛～我们在暗巷里交过手的那些家伙，可比她们强多了好吧？","zh-Hant":"妳在擔心什麼啦～我們之前在後巷打過交道的傢伙，隨便一個都比她們強好不好？","th":"กังวลอะไรกันเล่า~ แค่พวกที่เราเคยอัดในซอยเปลี่ยว ยังแข็งแกร่งกว่าพวกนี้ตั้งเยอะนะจะบอกให้?","es":"¿De qué te preocupas?~ ¡Los tíos con los que nos pegamos en los callejones eran mucho más fuertes que estas!"},"author":"victoria"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":130,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"suji.chaos","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":131,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji.closeeye","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":131,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"suji","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"아, 아니 강한 거 말고…","texts":{"en":"N-No, I didn't mean their strength...","ja":"あ、いや、強さのことじゃなくて…","zh-Hans":"不、不是说强弱的问题……","zh-Hant":"額，不是強不強的問題……","th":"มะ... ไม่ใช่เรื่องความแข็งแกร่งสักหน่อย...","es":"N-No, si no me refiero a la fuerza..."},"author":"suji"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":132,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"victoria.smile","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":132,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"victoria","RevealSpeed":"1.0","WaitForInput":"1","Wait":"1"},"text":"괜찮아, 괜찮아~ 나만 믿어!","texts":{"en":"It's fine, it's fine! Just trust me!","ja":"大丈夫、大丈夫～☆ 私を信じなさいって！","zh-Hans":"没关系，没关系～相信我就是了！","zh-Hant":"沒事啦、沒事啦～相信我準沒錯！","th":"ไม่เป็นไร ไม่เป็นไรน่า~ เชื่อมือฉันสิ!","es":"¡No pasa nada, no pasa nada!~ ¡Confía en mí!"},"author":"victoria"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":132,"inline":2,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji.fear","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":132,"inline":3,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"suji.surprise","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Spawn","line":132,"inline":4,"fields":{"Path":"ShakePrinter","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":132,"inline":5,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Cartoonrun_01","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":132,"inline":6,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"victoria.happy","Wait":"false","Destination":"55,,70","Duration":"0.2","Visible":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":132,"inline":7,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"victoria","Wait":"false","Power":"-5","Duration":"0.1","Count":"6","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":132,"inline":8,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"victoria","RevealSpeed":"1.0","ResetPrinter":"0","Append":"1","Wait":"1"},"text":"꺄하하하하!!","texts":{"en":"Kyahahaha!!","ja":"きゃはははは！！","zh-Hans":"呀哈哈哈哈！！","zh-Hant":"啊哈哈哈！！","th":"คยาฮาฮาฮา!!","es":"¡¡Cajajajaja!!"},"author":"victoria"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":133,"fields":{}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":134,"fields":{"ActorIds":"suji"}},{"class":"CharacterStiffCommand","line":135,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji","Wait":"false","Power":"0.1","Count":"2","Lazy":"0","Duration":"0.10000000149011612"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":136,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"suji.sweat3","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":137,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1.2"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":138,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji","Wait":"false","Destination":"50,,60","Duration":"0.2","Visible":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":139,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"suji","Wait":"false","Power":"-5","Duration":"0.1","Count":"6","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":140,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1.8"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":142,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":143,"fields":{"Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"25,,0.001","IdAndAppearance":"freya.question","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":144,"fields":{"Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"45,,0","IdAndAppearance":"theta.closeeye","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":145,"fields":{"Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"75,,0.001","IdAndAppearance":"lumina.happy","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":146,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":147,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.surprise","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":148,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":149,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.serious","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":149,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"에잇, 우리도 장사꾼들에게 질 순 없지!!","texts":{"en":"Come on, we can't let those merchants beat us!!","ja":"えいっ、私たちも商人なんかに負けてられないよ！！","zh-Hans":"哎呀，我们也不能输给这些商人！！","zh-Hant":"嘿，我們可不能輸給那些做生意的傢伙！！","th":"ย่าห์ พวกเราเองจะไปยอมแพ้พวกแม่ค้าไม่ได้เหมือนกันนะ!!","es":"¡Bah, nosotros tampoco podemos perder contra unas comerciantes!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":150,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.chat","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":151,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya","Wait":"false","Power":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":152,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.happy","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":152,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"메이드 가장 적게 쓰러뜨린 사람은 일주일간 아지트 청소다!","texts":{"en":"Whoever defeats the fewest maids has to clean the hideout for a week!","ja":"メイドを倒した数が一番少ないやつは、一週間アジトの掃除な！","zh-Hans":"打倒女仆数量最少的人，打扫基地一个星期！","zh-Hant":"打倒女僕人數最少的那個人，罰掃秘密基地一星期！","th":"คนที่ล้มเมดได้น้อยที่สุด ต้องทำความสะอาดฐานลับหนึ่งสัปดาห์นะ!!","es":"¡Quien derrote a menos Maids limpiará la guarida durante una semana!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":153,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"lumina.default","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":153,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"lumina","RevealSpeed":"1.0","WaitForInput":"1","Wait":"1"},"text":"어머, 그것도 재밌을 것 같네요~","texts":{"en":"Oh my, that sounds fun!","ja":"あら、面白そうですわね～","zh-Hans":"哎呀，听起来挺有意思的嘛～","zh-Hant":"哎呀，這好像挺有趣的～","th":"คุณพระ น่าสนุกดีเหมือนกันนะคะ~","es":"Vaya, eso suena muy divertido~"},"author":"lumina"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":153,"inline":2,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"lumina.smile","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":153,"inline":3,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"lumina.love","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":153,"inline":4,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"lumina","RevealSpeed":"1.0","ResetPrinter":"0","Append":"1","Wait":"1"},"text":"하는 김에 빨래도 맡는 걸로 하죠~","texts":{"en":"Let's make them do the laundry too.","ja":"ついでに洗濯もやってもらいましょう～","zh-Hans":"顺便连洗衣服的活也包了吧～","zh-Hant":"順便連洗衣服也包辦了吧～","th":"ไหนๆ แล้วก็ให้รับหน้าที่ซักผ้าไปด้วยเลยสิคะ~","es":"Ya que estamos, incluyamos también hacer la colada~"},"author":"lumina"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":154,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"theta.twinkle","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":155,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"theta.smile","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":155,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"theta","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"대장 포함이면 안전자산 아닙니까.","texts":{"en":"If the leader counts too, isn't that basically a guaranteed win?","ja":"隊長を含めるなら、安全資産ですね。","zh-Hans":"把老大也算进去的话，不是稳赢吗。","zh-Hant":"如果老大也算在內的話，這可是一筆穩賺不賠的交易呢。","th":"ถ้านับรวมหัวหน้าไปด้วย แบบนี้ไม่ถือว่าเป็นสินทรัพย์ที่ปลอดภัยเหรอคะ","es":"Si incluye al jefe, es un valor seguro."},"author":"theta"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":156,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":157,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"Await","line":158,"fields":{}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":159,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.happy","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":160,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"theta.happy","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":161,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"lumina.happy","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":162,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"theta","Wait":"false","Destination":"52,,60","Duration":"0.2","Visible":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":163,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"theta","Wait":"false","Power":"-5","Duration":"0.1","Count":"6","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":164,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"lumina","Wait":"false","Destination":"71,,60","Duration":"0.2","Visible":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":165,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"lumina","Wait":"false","Power":"-5","Duration":"0.1","Count":"6","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":166,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya","Wait":"false","Destination":"30,,25","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":167,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.5"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":168,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.smile","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":169,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.question","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":170,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":171,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.surprise","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":172,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.35"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":173,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.unique01","Wait":"false","Destination":"50,,0","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":174,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya","Wait":"false","Power":"-5","Duration":"0.1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":176,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":177,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.chat","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":178,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"하긴, 대빵은 싸움 못하니까~ 헤헹, 청소는 잘 부탁할게?","texts":{"en":"True, Big Boss can't fight anyway! Heheh, I'll leave the cleaning to you!","ja":"確かに、隊長は戦えないもんね～！ へへっ、掃除はよろしく頼むよ？","zh-Hans":"也对，反正老大也不会打架～嘿嘿，打扫卫生就拜托你咯？","zh-Hant":"說得也是，反正老大根本不會打架～嘿嘿，打掃就拜託你囉？","th":"นั่นสิ ลูกพี่ต่อสู้ไม่เก่งนี่นา~ เฮะเฮ่อ ฝากทำความสะอาดด้วยล่ะ?","es":"Es verdad, como el Gran Jefe no sabe luchar~ Jeje, ¡te encargo la limpieza!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"Await","line":179,"fields":{}},{"class":"PrintText","line":180,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"내가 대장이니까 너희 쓰러뜨린 인원수 다 합산해서 내꺼야.","texts":{"en":"Since I'm the leader, all your takedowns count toward my total.","ja":"俺が隊長だから、お前たちの討伐数は全部合算して俺のものだ。","zh-Hans":"既然我是老大，你们打倒的人数全算我的。","zh-Hant":"既然我是老大，那妳們打倒的人數也應該全部合併算成我的。","th":"เพราะฉันเป็นหัวหน้า จำนวนคนที่พวกเธอจัดการได้ทั้งหมดก็นับมารวมเป็นของฉันสิ","es":"Como soy el jefe, sumaré las bajas de todas vosotras y me las atribuiré."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":181,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.anger","Wait":"false","Power":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":182,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.angry2","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":183,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"뭐, 뭐야! 그런 게 어딨어!!!","texts":{"en":"Wh-What?! You can't just make up rules like that!!!","ja":"な、何それ！ そんなのあり！？","zh-Hans":"什、什么！哪有这样的！！！","zh-Hant":"什、什麼嘛！哪有這種規則！！！","th":"อะ... อะไรกัน! แบบนั้นมันมีที่ไหนกันเล่า!!!","es":"¡¿Q-Qué?! ¡¡¡Eso es tramposo!!!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"PrintText","line":184,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"여기.","texts":{"en":"Yes I can.","ja":"ここにある。","zh-Hans":"就在这儿。","zh-Hant":"這裡就有。","th":"ตรงนี้ไง","es":"Pues aquí mismo."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":185,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.serious","Wait":"false","Destination":"Near","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":186,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya","Wait":"false","Power":"3","Duration":"0.05","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":187,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.angry","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":188,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"불공평해!!","texts":{"en":"That's unfair!!","ja":"不公平だよ！！","zh-Hans":"太不公平了！！","zh-Hant":"這不公平！！","th":"ไม่ยุติธรรมเลย!!","es":"¡¡Es injusto!!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"PrintText","line":189,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"꼬우면 직접 지휘하던가. 근데 너 그거 못 견디잖아.","texts":{"en":"If you don't like it, lead the group yourself. But you can't handle that, can you?","ja":"不満なら自分で指揮を執ってみろよ。どうせお前には耐えられないだろ。","zh-Hans":"不服气你自己来指挥啊。但你又受不了那个。","zh-Hant":"不服氣的話，妳來當指揮啊。但妳根本受不了那種麻煩對吧。","th":"ถ้าไม่พอใจจะมาบัญชาการเองก็ได้นะ แต่เธอทนทำเรื่องแบบนั้นไม่ไหวหรอกใช่มั้ยล่ะ","es":"Si te molesta, dirige tú misma. Aunque sé que no aguantarías la presión."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":190,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.angry3","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":191,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.anger","Wait":"false","Power":"5","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":192,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"불공평해!!!!!!!","texts":{"en":"That's so unfair!!!!!!!","ja":"不公平だよ！！！！！！！","zh-Hans":"太不公平了！！！！！！！","zh-Hant":"太不公平了啦！！！！！！！","th":"ไม่ยุติธรรมเลย!!!!!!!","es":"¡¡¡¡¡¡¡Es injusto!!!!!!!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"PrintText","line":193,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"어어, 그러다가 너 꼴찌 한다. 세타와 루미나는 벌써…","texts":{"en":"Oh-oh, keep that up and you'll end up in last place. Theta and Lumina are already...","ja":"おっと、そうしてる間に最下位になるぞ。セタとルミナはもう…","zh-Hans":"喂喂，再这样下去你要垫底了。塞塔和露米娜已经……","zh-Hant":"哎呀呀，再這樣下去妳要拿最後一名囉。塞塔和露米娜早就在……","th":"เฮ้ๆ มัวแต่โวยวายเดี๋ยวก็ได้อันดับสุดท้ายหรอก ธีตากับลูมินาไปถึงไหนแล้วก็ไม่รู้...","es":"Oye, oye, como sigas así te vas a quedar la última. Theta y Lumina ya van..."},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":194,"fields":{"Visible":"true","Rotation":",,0","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"47,38,99","IdAndAppearance":"ma1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":195,"fields":{"Visible":"true","Rotation":",,0","ScenePosition":"53,38,98","IdAndAppearance":"mb1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":196,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.surprise3","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":197,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.embarrassed","Wait":"false","Power":"6","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Await","line":198,"fields":{}},{"class":"PrintText","line":199,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"아아악!!!","texts":{"en":"Aaaah!!!","ja":"あぁぁっ！！！","zh-Hans":"啊啊啊！！！","zh-Hant":"啊啊啊！！！","th":"กรี๊ดดด!!!","es":"¡¡¡Aaaagh!!!"},"author":"freya"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":200,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"Await","line":201,"fields":{}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":202,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":203,"indent":1,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":204,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.serious","Wait":"false","Destination":"50,,100","Duration":"0.2","Visible":"false","Lazy":"0"}